  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{array}{|l|l|l|}\n\\hline & \\begin{array}{l} \n\\text{Number of unpaired e}\n\\end{array} & \\mu=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{n}(\\mathrm{n}+2)} B.M. \\\\\n\\hline\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+} & 3 & 3.87 \\\\\n\\hline\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+} & 4 & 4.89 \\\\\n\\hline\\left[\\mathrm{Mn}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+} & 5 & 5.92 \\\\\n\\hline\\left[\\mathrm{Cr}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+} & 4 & 4.89 \\\\\n\\hline\n\\end{array}$\nLeast paramagnetic behaviour $=\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+}$",
